  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"49404501-d149-4fd0-a611-9c4b34f19530\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Please read <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Reporting Overview (Bahmni)\" ri:version-at-save=\"2\" /><ac:link-body>Bahmni Reporting Overview</ac:link-body></ac:link> first.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>Custom SQL Reports allow writing a specific SQL that executes on MRS, ELIS or Odoo. This will query the database directly. It is only recommended for tricky use-cases / edge cases where generic reports don&rsquo;t suffice. </p><p>Please read detailed documentation &amp; examples here: <ac:link ac:card-appearance=\"inline\" ac:anchor=\"3.CustomSQL\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Reporting Overview (Bahmni)\" ri:version-at-save=\"2\" /><ac:link-body>Reporting Overview (Bahmni)</ac:link-body></ac:link> </p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
