    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"49404501-d149-4fd0-a611-9c4b34f19530\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Please read <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2270265367/Reporting+Overview+Bahmni\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2270265367\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Reporting Overview</a> first.</p></div></div><p>Custom SQL Reports allow writing a specific SQL that executes on MRS, ELIS or Odoo. This will query the database directly. It is only recommended for tricky use-cases / edge cases where generic reports don’t suffice. </p><p>Please read detailed documentation &amp; examples here: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2270265367/Reporting+Overview+Bahmni#ReportingOverview(Bahmni)-3.CustomSQL\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2270265367\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Reporting Overview (Bahmni)</a> </p>",
